{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;We need your feedback&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is still in development, and we\u2019re looking forward to hearing what players think about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord and let us know what you love about it, and what could be improved\u2014your wishes might just come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Awaking Beauty Demo&quot; is a two-character roguelite action game that blends sci-fi and fantasy. You\u2019ll play as selected high school girls piloting dream-diving mechas to rescue those trapped in the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version is the prologue to the full game, focusing on the story of the first dream prisoner\u2014a high school girl reliving her nightmare again and again\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b Playable in both single-player and co-op modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u5922\u5883\u8207\u73fe\u5be6\u4ea4\u7e54_en.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 A Story Where Dreams and Reality Intertwine \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;I... can I become friends with everyone?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the prologue\u2019s exploration of the Dream World, you\u2019ll uncover the past of the first dream prisoner\u2014experiencing her memories, sorrow, and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u591a\u5143\u6d41\u6d3e\u6230\u9b25\u9ad4\u9a57_mid.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Close-range destruction? Or long-range suppression? You got it!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the prologue, choose one of two characters to enter battle, and customize your skills with chips randomly found during stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same weapon will behave differently depending on its attributes\u2014or who wields it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In co-op mode, you can reconfigure your partner pairing every time you return to the lab;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In single-player mode, your AI partner will assist in combat, and you can switch between characters anytime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u5922\u9583\u6e26\u8f2a_mini.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Dream-Turbo x Fusion Transformation \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dream-Turbo system converts nightmare energy into explosive combat power\u2014faster speed, stronger firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At critical moments, sync energy with your partner to trigger the two-player \u201cFusion Transformation\u201d and crush nightmares with overwhelming force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376120?t=1750768895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/5e97d284da582c060f98d88932448d56d3ba694d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750768895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/a7d540adb48714cc96a474ce0c19ce5755d0ca37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750768895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/a7d540adb48714cc96a474ce0c19ce5755d0ca37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750768895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;We need your feedback&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is still in development, and we\u2019re looking forward to hearing what players think about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord and let us know what you love about it, and what could be improved\u2014your wishes might just come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Awaking Beauty Demo&quot; is a two-character roguelite action game that blends sci-fi and fantasy. You\u2019ll play as selected high school girls piloting dream-diving mechas to rescue those trapped in the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version is the prologue to the full game, focusing on the story of the first dream prisoner\u2014a high school girl reliving her nightmare again and again\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b Playable in both single-player and co-op modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u5922\u5883\u8207\u73fe\u5be6\u4ea4\u7e54_en.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 A Story Where Dreams and Reality Intertwine \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;I... can I become friends with everyone?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the prologue\u2019s exploration of the Dream World, you\u2019ll uncover the past of the first dream prisoner\u2014experiencing her memories, sorrow, and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u591a\u5143\u6d41\u6d3e\u6230\u9b25\u9ad4\u9a57_mid.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Close-range destruction? Or long-range suppression? You got it!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the prologue, choose one of two characters to enter battle, and customize your skills with chips randomly found during stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same weapon will behave differently depending on its attributes\u2014or who wields it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In co-op mode, you can reconfigure your partner pairing every time you return to the lab;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In single-player mode, your AI partner will assist in combat, and you can switch between characters anytime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/\u5922\u9583\u5c11\u5973_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801\u8aaa\u660e_\u5206\u9694\u5143\u7d20_20250616.png?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/extras/20250615_Steam\u5546\u5e97\u9801_GIF_\u5922\u9583\u6e26\u8f2a_mini.gif?t=1750768895\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Dream-Turbo x Fusion Transformation \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Dream-Turbo system converts nightmare energy into explosive combat power\u2014faster speed, stronger firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At critical moments, sync energy with your partner to trigger the two-player \u201cFusion Transformation\u201d and crush nightmares with overwhelming force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["YOHCAN Co., Ltd."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3253950","name":"Awaking Beauty"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376120/c23c9b24030f262786fe6c4ac9ab1d925caca417/header.jpg?t=1750768895","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 YOHCAN Co., Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158396,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158396/movie480.mp4?t=1750272354","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158396/movie_max.mp4?t=1750272354"},"name":"Awaking Beauty Trailer \uff5cLet\u2019s save the world through dreaming\u2014together !","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158396/216dd0a4d08172880700ad8c35b5cad1759449e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750272354","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158396/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750272354","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158396/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750272354"}}],"name":"Awaking Beauty Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae i5-4590, AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms